  <section aria-labelledby="changes">
    <h2 id="changes">Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these Terms as the Service or law changes. We will update the date above and, when required, provide additional notice. Continuing to use the Service after an updated version takes effect means you accept it; if you do not agree, stop using the Service and cancel any renewal.
